>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `LINARITH_ext_ss_budgeted`

``` hol4
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_budgeted :
  Context.t -> searchBudget.budget -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides `LINARITH_ext_ss` charging the arithmetic work to a budget.

`LINARITH_ext_ss_budgeted ctxt budget` is the fragment of
[`LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss) whose facts are the
[`[arith]`](#linarithData.arith) facts of `ctxt` and whose arithmetic
search and replay are charged to `budget`. Its result cache belongs to
the fragment, not to the process.

### Failure

Applying the fragment's reducer raises `searchBudget.LimitReached` when
`budget` is exhausted. Otherwise as for
[`LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss).

### See also

[`linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss),
[`linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_with`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_with),
[`linarithData.arith`](#linarithData.arith)
